  "summary": "MPXJ: Potential Path Traversal Vulnerability in Primavera P3 PRX and SureTrak STX readers",
  "details": "### Impact\nWhen reading a suitably crafted PRX or STX file, MPXJ can be made to write files to arbitrary locations in the file system.\n\n### Patches\nThis issue is addressed in MPXJ version 16.5.0.\n\n### Workarounds\nDo not read PRX or STX files from untrusted sources.",
